      <h1>What Is Bitcoin Core?</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">Bitcoin Core is an open-source software project that implements a Bitcoin node and optional wallet interfaces. It validates blocks and transactions, maintains chainstate, communicates with peers, applies local relay policy, and exposes tools for operators and developers. It is influential software, but it is not Bitcoin itself and its maintainers do not control the network.</p>
